  "body": "As discussed in https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=614534, writing to a characteristic does not neccesarily mean that subsiquent reads will return that value. That behavior is peripheral dependent.\n\nI believe the [writevalue](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#dom-bluetoothremotegattcharacteristic-writevalue) line should be deleted:\n\n> Set this.value to a new DataView wrapping a new ArrayBuffer containing bytes.\n\nThis applies to characteristics and descriptors. \n",
